&TRACE OFF
***********************************************************************
*                                                                     *
* XEDIT INTERFACE TO 'CALC' EXEC THAT TRAPS EXEC2 ABEND (NUMERIC      *
* OVERFLOW) AND DISPLAYS ERROR MESSAGE WITHOUT TYPING THE ERROR.      *
*                                                                     *
*                                                                     *
* WRITTEN BY YOSSIE SILVERMAN, W.I.C.C, LAST UPDATE 23/7/83.          *
*                                                                     *
***********************************************************************
EXEC CALC XEDIT&ARGSTRING
&RC = &RC
&IF &RC = 10013 MSG WISCAL000E NUMERIC OVERFLOW.
&EXIT 0
